graph TD
    subgraph Old Logic: O(P * Pos)
        A1[Start] --> B1[For each Person P]
        B1 --> C1[For each Position Pos]
        C1 --> D1{Is Pos assigned to P?}
        D1 -- Yes --> E1[Mark P as Busy]
        D1 -- No --> C1
        E1 --> F1{Is P unavailable?}
        C1 -. Finished all Pos .-> F1
        F1 -- Yes --> G1[Mark P as Busy]
        F1 -- No --> B1
        G1 --> B1
        B1 -. Finished all P .-> H1[Done]
    end

    subgraph New Logic: O(P + Pos)
        A2[Start] --> B2[Initialize empty busyMap]
        B2 --> C2[For each Position Pos]
        C2 --> D2{Is Pos assigned?}
        D2 -- Yes --> E2[Add Assigned Person ID to busyMap]
        D2 -- No --> C2
        E2 --> C2
        C2 -. Finished all Pos .-> F2[For each Person P]
        F2 --> G2{Is P in busyMap?}
        G2 -- Yes --> H2[Mark P as Busy]
        G2 -- No --> I2{Is P unavailable?}
        I2 -- Yes --> H2
        I2 -- No --> F2
        H2 --> F2
        F2 -. Finished all P .-> J2[Done]
    end